OL,3,CPaul Scholes handed driving ban after
OL,4,Ctwo speeding prosecutions in two days
OL,6,FFormer Manchester United footballer
OL,7,FPaul Scholes has been handed a six-
OL,8,Fmonth road ban after he racked up two
OL,9,Fdriving convictions in the space of
OL,10,Ftwo days.
OL,12,FThe 51-year-old former midfielder was
OL,13,Fcaught speeding in a Range Rover in
OL,14,FMarch while on a late-night drive
OL,15,Fthrough Cleckheaton in West Yorkshire.
OL,17,FWest Yorkshire Police brought a
OL,18,Fprosecution over the incident, as
OL,19,FScholes's car was caught driving 37mph
OL,20,Fon a 30mph stretch of residential road.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
