OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1787080721
OL,3,CPaul Scholes handed driving ban after
OL,4,Ctwo speeding prosecutions in two days
OL,6,FThe ex-Man United and England star was
OL,7,Fthen also clocked by Greater
OL,8,FManchester Police after a Mercedes
OL,9,Fregistered in his name was caught
OL,10,Fdriving at 49mph in a 30mph zone in
OL,11,FNovember 2025.
OL,13,FScholes was then prosecuted for
OL,14,Ffailing to respond to two police
OL,15,Fletters asking for confirmation that
OL,16,Fhe had been the speeding driver.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
