OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1787080721
OL,3,CPaul Scholes handed driving ban after
OL,4,Ctwo speeding prosecutions in two days
OL,6,FThe two criminal cases culminated in
OL,7,Fhearings on two days in August, when
OL,8,FScholes was handed a six-month driving
OL,9,Fban and ordered to pay fines, costs,
OL,10,Fand court fees totalling #1,472.
OL,12,FA court official said Scholes, who was
OL,13,Fprosecuted in private hearings under
OL,14,Fthe Single Justice Procedure, did not
OL,15,Fenter pleas to either of the charges
OL,16,Fhe faced and was convicted in his
OL,17,Fabsence.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
