OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1787080721
OL,3,CPaul Scholes handed driving ban after
OL,4,Ctwo speeding prosecutions in two days
OL,6,FScholes played 499 times for
OL,7,FManchester United and won 66 England
OL,8,Fcaps in a trophy-laden career which
OL,9,Fincluded 11 Premier League titles,
OL,10,Fthree FA Cup wins, and two Champions
OL,11,FLeague triumphs.
OL,13,FCourt documents show Scholes's Range
OL,14,FRover was caught speeding at just
OL,15,Fafter 11.30pm on 3 March on the A649
OL,16,FHalifax Road near Cleckheaton.
OL,18,FPolice said the former footballer
OL,19,Freplied to a notice of intended
OL,20,Fprosecution, confirming he had been
OL,21,Fthe driver.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1787080721
OL,3,CPaul Scholes handed driving ban after
OL,4,Ctwo speeding prosecutions in two days
OL,6,FThe court papers noted that Scholes
OL,7,Fcould not be offered the chance of an
OL,8,Fout-of-court settlement with a speed
OL,9,Fawareness course as he is a "totter" `
OL,10,Fmeaning he already had penalty points
OL,11,Fon his licence and was now in line for
OL,12,Fan automatic ban.
OL,14,FIn the second case, Scholes's Mercedes
OL,15,Fbroke the speed limit on the A670
OL,16,FMossley Road near Ashton-under-Lyne at
OL,17,F11.10am on 14 November 2025.
OL,19,FPolice said two letters were sent to
OL,20,Fhis home and "no reply has been
OL,21,Freceived".
OL,26,@qD@]OUqD@dO]|D@NOU}D@IO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
