FL,366,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1787080721
OL,3,CPaul Scholes handed driving ban after
OL,4,Ctwo speeding prosecutions in two days
OL,6,FAt court, the force dropped the
OL,7,Fspeeding allegation but continued to
OL,8,Fprosecute Scholes for failing to reply
OL,9,Fto the letters.
OL,11,FOn 12 August at Bradford Magistrates'
OL,12,FCourt, he was handed a six-month
OL,13,Fdriving ban for the speeding offence,
OL,14,Falong with a #220 fine, #120 costs,
OL,15,Fand an #88 victim surcharge.
OL,17,FThe following day at Manchester
OL,18,FMagistrates' Court, Scholes was
OL,19,Fsentenced to a #660 fine, with six
OL,20,Fpenalty points for his licence, #120
OL,21,Fcosts, and a #264 victim surcharge.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
